{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.950000762939453,"text":"Start with the bag. It's brand new. This is the Vivian from Volanta. It's a banky inspired shape, but soft. All vegetable tanned leather, brass hardware, no logo anywhere. Coat is Max Mara. The knit is Vince. Boots are Manolo. Carrier. It was a gift from my husband. It's on pre-order right now. Ships in October. Four colors. I got the chocolate. Links below.","words":[{"word":"Start","start":0.0,"end":0.699999988079071},{"word":"with","start":0.699999988079071,"end":0.8600000143051147},{"word":"the","start":0.8600000143051147,"end":1.059999942779541},{"word":"bag","start":1.059999942779541,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"It's","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":1.8600000143051147},{"word":"brand","start":1.8600000143051147,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"new","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.5999999046325684},{"word":"This","start":3.2799999713897705,"end":3.380000114440918},{"word":"is","start":3.380000114440918,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"the","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"Vivian","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"from","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.440000057220459},{"word":"Volanta","start":4.440000057220459,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"It's","start":5.360000133514404,"end":5.71999979019165},{"word":"a","start":5.71999979019165,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"banky","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.300000190734863},{"word":"inspired","start":6.300000190734863,"end":6.760000228881836},{"word":"shape","start":6.760000228881836,"end":7.21999979019165},{"word":"but","start":7.440000057220459,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"soft","start":7.71999979019165,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"All","start":8.600000381469727,"end":8.800000190734863},{"word":"vegetable","start":8.800000190734863,"end":9.180000305175781},{"word":"tanned","start":9.180000305175781,"end":9.479999542236328},{"word":"leather","start":9.479